# Production deployment

Live site: https://csm.ceylonautomobile.co.nz  
Server: `root@170.64.179.199` · app dir `/opt/ceylon-crm`  
SSH: `-i "$env:USERPROFILE\.ssh\id_rsa"`

## Preferred deploy (avoid server OOM)

Do **not** run Vite/`npm run build` on the server — it OOMs. Build frontend locally, rebuild backend in Docker, copy frontend dist into nginx.

```powershell
# 1) Local frontend build
cd c:\CeylonAutomobile\CRM\frontend; npm run build

# 2) Package + upload
cd c:\CeylonAutomobile\CRM
tar -czf "$env:TEMP\csm-crm-be.tar.gz" -C backend --exclude=node_modules --exclude=dist --exclude=tmp-*.js .
tar -czf "$env:TEMP\csm-crm-fe-dist.tar.gz" -C frontend dist
scp -i "$env:USERPROFILE\.ssh\id_rsa" "$env:TEMP\csm-crm-be.tar.gz" "$env:TEMP\csm-crm-fe-dist.tar.gz" root@170.64.179.199:/tmp/

# 3) Remote apply (use ssh @' ... '@ heredoc on PowerShell)
```

Remote steps:

```bash
cd /opt/ceylon-crm/backend && tar -xzf /tmp/csm-crm-be.tar.gz
cd /opt/ceylon-crm/frontend && rm -rf dist && tar -xzf /tmp/csm-crm-fe-dist.tar.gz
cd /opt/ceylon-crm
docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml build backend
docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml up -d backend
# Schema changes only:
docker exec csm-crm-backend npx prisma db push --skip-generate
docker cp /opt/ceylon-crm/frontend/dist/. csm-crm-frontend:/usr/share/nginx/html/
curl -sf http://127.0.0.1:5020/health
```

## Rules

- Frontend-only change → local `npm run build` + `docker cp` dist (skip backend rebuild).
- Backend/schema change → rebuild backend container + `prisma db push` when schema changed.
- Never rebuild/restart host nginx or touch SSL certs unless explicitly asked.
- Never commit or upload `.env` / `deploy/.env.production` secrets to public remotes.
- Containers: `csm-crm-backend`, `csm-crm-frontend` (compose file `docker-compose.prod.yml`).
